  _headline: "Merenda da escola agora vem da ro\xE7a da regi\xE3o"
  _headlineEn: School lunch now comes from local farms
  _body: "Alface colhida ontem, feij\xE3o do s\xEDtio vizinho. J\xFAlia garante que
    o refeit\xF3rio nunca teve fila t\xE3o longa."
  _bodyEn: "Lettuce picked yesterday, beans from the farm next door. J\xFAlia says
    the cafeteria line has never been this long."
